27488000},"page":"55-74","source":"Crossref","is-referenced-by-count":0,"title":["Do You Know How to Develop Your\n\t\t\t\t\t\tResearch Design and Methodology?"],"prefix":"10.4135","member":"179","container-title":["Writing your Doctoral Dissertation or Thesis Faster: A Proven Map to Success"],"link":[{"URL":"http:\/\/journals.sagepub.com\/doi\/pdf\/10.4135\/9781506374727.n4","content-type":"unspecified","content-version":"vor","intended-application":"similarity-checking"}],"deposited":{"date-parts":[[2022,4,27]],"date-time":"2022-04-27T18:21:47Z","timestamp":1651083707000},"score":27.952875,"resource":{"primary":{"URL":"https:\/\/methods.sagepub.com\/book\/writing-your-doctoral-dissertation-or-thesis-faster\/i773.xml"}},"issued":{"date-parts":[[2014]]},"references-count":0,"alternative-id":["10.4135\/9781506374727"],"URL":"https:\/\/doi.org\/10.4135\/9781506374727.n4","published":{"date-parts":[[2014]]}},{"indexed":{"date-parts":[[2026,10,22]],"date-time":"2026-10-22T10:38:41Z","timestamp":1792665521115,"version":"4.5.0"},"reference-count":0,"publisher":"Oxford University Press","isbn-type":[{"value":"9780190636036","type":"print"},{"value":"9780190636067","type":"electronic"}],"content-domain":{"domain":[],"crossmark-restriction":false},"published-print":{"date-parts":[[2018,10]]},"abstract":"<p>On December 28, 1885, Gilles de la Tourette defended his doctoral thesis in medicine with his teacher, Jean-Martin Charcot, presiding over the jury. The subject, proposed by Charcot himself, involved studying footprints made on sheets of white paper and establishing gait anomalies during various stages of neurological disorders. Gilles de la Tourette spent 1884 and 1885 working on his thesis. His footprints graphical study, which may appear simplistic, is the first of its kind in neurology, making it innovative and valuable. It drew on similar orthopedic studies previously conducted in other European countries. These studies are reviewed here, and the genesis, technical aspects, and results of Gilles de la Tourette\u2019s study are analyzed. The impact of his thesis is examined based on summaries published in the medical press and the fact that Gilles de la Tourette was awarded a prize by the Acad\u00e9mie de M\u00e9decine for this work.<\/p>","DOI":"10.1093\/med\/9780190636036.003.0008","type":"book-chapter","created":{"date-parts":[[2019,1,28]],"date-time":"2019-01-28T13:49:25Z","timestamp":1548683365000},"page":"129-144","source":"Crossref","is-referenced-by-count":5,"title":["Doctoral Thesis"],"prefix":"10.1093","author":[{"given":"Olivier","family":"Walusinski","sequence":"additional","affiliation":[],"role":[{"vocabulary":"crossref","role":"author"}]}],"member":"286","published-online":{"date-parts":[[2018,11]]},"container-title":["Georges Gilles de la Tourette"],"original-title":["Doctoral Thesis"],"language":"en","deposited":{"date-parts":[[2022,8,3]],"date-time":"2022-08-03T01:31:19Z","timestamp":1659490279000},"score":27.531912,"resource":{"primary":{"URL":"https:\/\/academic.oup.com\/book\/24666\/chapter\/188065850"}},"editor":[{"given":"Olivier","family":"Walusinski","sequence":"first","affiliation":[],"role":[{"vocabulary":"crossref","role":"editor"}]}],"issued":{"date-parts":[[2018,10]]},"ISBN":["9780190636036","9780190636067"],"references-count":0,"URL":"https:\/\/doi.org\/10.1093\/med\/9780190636036.003.0008","published":{"date-parts":[[2018,10]]}},{"institution":[{"name":"Latvian Academy of Sport Education"}],"indexed":{"date-parts":[[2025,5,20]],"date-time":"2025-05-20T04:01:46Z","timestamp":1747713706827,"version":"3.40.5"},"reference-count":1,"publisher":"Riga Stradins University","content-domain":{"domain":[],"crossmark-restriction":false},"DOI":"10.25143\/prom-rsu-lspa_2023-03_dt","type":"dissertation","created":{"date-parts":[[2025,5,19]],"date-time":"2025-05-19T07:37:32Z","timestamp":1747640252000},"approved":{"date-parts":[[2023,6,15]]},"source":"Crossref","is-referenced-by-count":1,"title":["Effect of Outdoo